ken=\"v2-327b067385912d84fa840c3e5a729bac\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-327b067385912d84fa840c3e5a729bac_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1520\"/></figure><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-c586efc06b79e9792302164bd6a62693_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-0a1e93d595285ec8a17cd475e6b76f39\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-0a1e93d595285ec8a17cd475e6b76f39_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1520\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-c586efc06b79e9792302164bd6a62693_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-0a1e93d595285ec8a17cd475e6b76f39\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-0a1e93d595285ec8a17cd475e6b76f39_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1520\"/></figure><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-ce673568d3a930ad93523c4ab391968f_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-8014540c421a0af285ae6529b2bfa893\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-8014540c421a0af285ae6529b2bfa893_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1520\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-ce673568d3a930ad93523c4ab391968f_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-8014540c421a0af285ae6529b2bfa893\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-8014540c421a0af285ae6529b2bfa893_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1520\"/></figure><h2 id=\"sec-1\">学校即监狱</h2><blockquote data-pid=\"7v_JxAcn\">摘自 <a class=\"member_mention\" data-hash=\"4c592f496dc33822b560b382907ff1d0\" data-hovercard=\"p$b$4c592f496dc33822b560b382907ff1d0\" href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/people/L.M.Sherlock\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">@Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组的译文《<a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"619039070\" href=\"#/post/619039070\">「为什么学生不喜欢上学？」呃，呵呵……》</a></blockquote><p data-pid=\"r7r71fMj\">如果你认为学校不是监狱，请解释二者的区别。</p><p data-pid=\"gRe1bHl-\">我能想到的唯一区别是：要进监狱，你必须<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://www.psychologytoday.com/us/basics/law-and-crime\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">犯罪</a>，而把你送进学校，只需要你的年龄到了。在其他方面，学校和监狱是一样的。在这两个地方，你的自由和尊严都被剥夺了。他们会告诉你必须做什么，如果你不遵守，你就会受到惩罚。事实上，比起在成人监狱里，你在学校里必须花更多的时间，去做规定的事情，所以在这个意义上，学校比监狱更糟糕。</p><p data-pid=\"AeDPGuFc\">在某种程度上，每个上过学的人在潜意识里都知道学校就是监狱。他们怎么会不知道呢？但人们会通过说（不过通常不是用这些字眼）「孩子们需要这种特殊的监狱」来合理化它，如果监狱管理得好，孩子们甚至会喜欢这种监狱。根据这种<span class=\"nolink\">合理化</span>的说法，如果孩子们不喜欢学校，并不是因为学校是监狱，而是因为「狱卒」不够善良，不够有趣，或不够聪明，没有恰当地侵占孩子们的思想。</p><p data-pid=\"u40MANJO\">但任何了解孩子的人，只要诚实地思考，就应该能看穿这种合理化。孩子们和所有人类一样，渴望自由。他们讨厌自由受到限制。在很大程度上，他们正是通过自由来自我教育。他们生来就有这种能力。在我以前的文章中，我曾多次谈论过这些内容。孩子们通过探索和自由玩耍，以了解他们成长过程中所面临的物质和社会世界。而在学校里，他们被告知必须停止追求自己的兴趣，而是要完全按照老师的要求去做。这就是他们不喜欢上学的原因。</p><hr/><h2 id=\"sec-2\">相关文章</h2><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-ee33b2bb18327ac4b1e6be98258614fa_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"2560\" data-image-width=\"3840\" data-tm-id=\"704266916\" href=\"#/post/704266916\">Thoughts Memo：学校的目标即是服从</a><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-e07edf48cabba57eb336685f95e7fe1b_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"425\" data-image-width=\"600\" data-tm-id=\"513109845\" href=\"#/post/513109845\">Thoughts Memo：Gray：学校即监狱</a><p></p>","rec_chain":[{"id":"704266916","title":"学校的目标即是服从","author":"Robin Hanson","votes":233,"minutes":6,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"513109845","title":"Gray：学校即监狱","author":"Peter Gray","votes":131,"minutes":2,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"619039070","title":"「为什么学生不喜欢上学？」呃，呵呵……","author":"Peter Gray","votes":216,"minutes":5,"reason":"本回答Level 3 引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"618183325","title":"反对教育根本变革的力量","author":"Peter Gray","votes":85,"minutes":9,"reason":"延伸深读 · Peter Gray"},{"id":"70779863","title":"20 孩子们为什么讨厌学校？","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":61,"minutes":9,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"},{"id":"706372143","title":"反对学校：公共教育束缚我们孩子的手段及目的","author":"John Taylor Gatto","votes":81,"minutes":14,"reason":"延伸深读 · John Taylor Gatto"},{"id":"639266845","title":"校园霸凌：专制学校的悲惨代价","author":"Peter Gray","votes":342,"minutes":9,"reason":"延伸深读 · Peter Gray"},{"id":"620349991","title":"强制教育系统的七大罪行","author":"Peter Gray","votes":142,"minutes":9,"reason":"延伸深读 · Peter Gray"}],"rec_answers":[{"id":"3470483376","title":"山东曲阜师大一学院新规「不得以任何理由用电子产品，包括电脑」，如何看待此事？大学「高中化」还要走多远？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":793,"minutes":2,"reason":"相似问答 · 793 赞同"},{"id":"3195300131","title":"现在的孩子们为什么都不爱上学了？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":88,"minutes":5,"reason":"相似问答 · 88 赞同"},{"id":"1933252840454873451","title":"如何看待越来越多的中学生把自己的学校称为「监狱」？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":62,"minutes":12,"reason":"相似问答 · 62 赞同"},{"id":"3473421056","title":"当代学校教育形式与监狱的区别？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":73,"minutes":1,"reason":"相似问答 · 73 赞同"},{"id":"2988298222","title":"美国的民主虚伪性体现在哪？有什么事例吗？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":65,"minutes":4,"reason":"相似问答 · 65 赞同"}]}